AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0030160> "Cervicitis, which most commonly presents as vaginal discharge or postcoital bleeding, can be acute or chronic, with an infectious or noninfectious etiology.")
