AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0030162> "Glomerulomegaly is a histologic finding that can be present in idiopathic pulmonary hypertension, congenital cyanotic heart disease, morbid obesity associated with sleep apnea syndrome, sickle cell disease, and polycythemic states.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0030162> "Glomerulomegaly")
