# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0030683> (Recurrent bacterial vaginosis)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0030683> "Repeated symptomatic episodes of inflammation of the vagina that can result from a spectrum of conditions that cause vaginal and sometimes vulvar symptoms, such as itching, burning, irritation, odor, and vaginal discharge.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0030683> "2015-12-28T18:16:07Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
