AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0030684> "Lower circulating adiponectin levels is associated with obesity and negatively correlated with insulin resistance. Adiponectin may exert antidiabetic, anti-atherogenic and anti-inflammatory activities in metabolic diseases.")
