AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0030858> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7674-1767>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0030858> <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2598-6622>)
