AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0030858> "Several behaviors, besides ingesting psychoactive substances, produce short-term rewards that may lead to persistent behavior despite knowledge of adverse consequences, such as diminished control over the behavior.")
