AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0031030> "Cancer-antigen 125 (CA-125) is used as a biomarker for ovarian and other cancers. Mucin 16 (cancer antigen 125) is a cell surface glycoprotein that plays a role in promoting cancer cell growth in ovarian cancer.")
