AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0031247> "The term whooping cough is usually used to describe the disease caused by infection of the respiratory tract with Bordatella pertussis. This HPO term refers to the major symptom of that disease.")
