# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032101> (Unusual infection)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032101> "Increased susceptibility to infection, as manifested by recurrent infection, severe or invasive infection, infection occurring in an unusual anatomical location, or infection with opportunistic organisms, that is unusual for a healthy individual of the same age.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032101> <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7601-9822>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032101> <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9382-150X>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032101> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2029-0733>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032101> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3577-9021>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032101> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4315-9105>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032101> <https://orcid.org/0009-0004-8124-8864>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032101> "2018-11-04T22:23:03Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032101> "There are five general subtypes. (i) Opportunistic infection, meaning infection by a pathogen that is not normally able to cause infection in a healthy host (e.g., pneumonia by Pneumocystis jirovecii or CMV); (ii) Unusual location (focus) of an infection (e.g., an aspergillus brain abscess); (iii) a protracted course or lack of adequate response to treatment (e.g., chronic rhinosinusitis); (iv) Unusual severity or intensity of an infection; and (v) unusual recurrence of infections.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032101> "Unusual infection")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032101> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0010978>)

