AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032162> "Increased susceptibility to infection of the skin, nails, or mucous membranes, as manifested by recurrent or severe cutaneous or mucosal infection, or by skin or mucous membrane infection caused by an atypical or opportunistic organism.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032162> <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7601-9822>)
