AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8169-9049>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29695388") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032397> "The amount of citrulline in the urine, when normalized for urine concentration, is above the upper limit of normal.")
