AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0034274> "Gastrointestinal ulcers result from the tissue necrosis triggered by mucosal ischemia, ree radical formation and cessation of nutrient delivery, all caused by vascular and microvascular injury such as thrombi, constriction, or other occlusion.")
